{"id":"Wd84bb9a9a3616cfea6532e6a","zh":"轮轨密贴模型","en":"","name":"轮轨密贴模型","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C2a880f9d890ef3cb82a8","families":[],"definition_zh":"文中以轮轨紧密接触约束表达车辆与轨道联系的模型。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于车辆—轨道动力学建模，以位移约束连接轮对与钢轨，表达轮轨间的运动联系。其处理忽略轮轨接触弹性压缩，不计入这部分变形造成的相对位移。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wd84bb9a9a3616cfea6532e6a","text":"轮轨密贴模型","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S0694f8431547fc4ea989","source_id":"P108","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"2.1.2 轮轨密贴模型曾庆元等[2−3]采用的模型均为轮轨密贴模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S905d0e58bb6ea7d5b0a5","source_id":"P108","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"虽然轮轨密贴模型计算结果表明存在跳轨现象,但其跳轨持续时间及响应幅值没有得到正确反映。","citations":[{"source_id":"P108","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P108":{"id":"P108","title":"基于轮轨时变接触刚度的车辆−轨道系统垂向振动分析","authors":"贺天龙,陈宪麦,徐磊","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672−7207.2017.08.023","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"贺天龙等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-vehicle-track-system-vertical-vibration-analysis-based-on-wheel-rail-time-varying-contact-stiffness"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"以位移约束连接轮对与钢轨、忽略接触弹性压缩的模型。","language":"zh","source_id":"P108","paper_slug":"2017-vehicle-track-system-vertical-vibration-analysis-based-on-wheel-rail-time-varying-contact-stiffness","title":"基于轮轨时变接触刚度的车辆−轨道系统垂向振动分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wa4e4ed5c9b6fb39a70d01c59","name":"tight contact model","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W2ad44fa1f43e068f1d5b4b56","name":"wheel-rail tight contact model","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wa4e4ed5c9b6fb39a70d01c59","name":"tight contact